		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4179&amp;p=31786#p31786"><![CDATA[
A new Beta version is now available which fixes multiple bugs<br><br><span style="font-size:150%;line-height:116%">EDIT.<br><br>This version appears to have problems then used with simplex hotspots.  <br>If you experience any problems with this version please download the previous beta and reinstall</span><br><br><a href="http://www.opengd77.com/downloads/GD77/Firmware/d818421d4dbc3fc08fba11490b95936d172e379e" class="postlink">http://www.opengd77.com/downloads/GD77/ ... 6d172e379e</a><br><br><a href="http://www.opengd77.com/downloads/GD77/Firmware/Latest" class="postlink">http://www.opengd77.com/downloads/GD77/Firmware/Latest</a><br><br>Changes in this version<br><br>* Add Hotspot SMS passthrough function - Thanks for multiple authors including DL4LEX and Daniel for incorporating this change.<br>* Reinstate Private call alarm beep<br>* Add safe boot functionality (minimum functionality boot)<br>* Fix cursor Y position problem on RD-5R<br>* Fix Hotspot echo bug and change hotspot version number<br>* Fix DTMF tone cancellation problem<br>* Fix TimeSlot detection and synchronisation when TimeSlot filter is disabled<br>* Fix bug with edit cursor problems<br>* Fix voltage history plotting bug<br>* Fix phantom PTT tiggering bug<br>* Changes to hardware debug screen<br><br>Thanks to Daniel F1RMB for all these changes<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Mon Jun 24, 2024 9:24 am</p><hr />
]]></content>
